<title>POLAND: BIG group net up at PLN 110 mln in 1996.</title>
<headline>BIG group net up at PLN 110 mln in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG group results for financial year ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>In million zlotys unless stated otherwise.</p>
<p>							     1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit			 104.73     110.91</p>
<p>    Group net					  109.65	75.07</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax				    100.32     101.87</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA.</p>
<p>    Group revenues from securities		1.75	  4.28</p>
<p>    Group revenues from commission	     30.21	 26.50</p>
<p>    Group interest and similar revenues     485.69	363.53</p>
<p>    Group interest and similar costs	  319.89	217.38</p>
<p>    Group costs of commission		    12.97	 11.44</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		 3,559.56 vs 1,888.67</p>
<p>    Group income tax				  7.55 vs    na</p>
<p>    Group other taxes				 4.93 vs    na</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss			0.46 vs    na</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
